  "description": "Protected his entire life by his loyal butler, Se-Jin, young heir Lee Han-Eul is discovering the real world for the very first time. As he tastes freedom, friendship, and first love, long-buried secrets begin to resurface. Why does Se-Jin seem to care for him as much as he watches over him? The discovery of a terrible secret about his birth will fundamentally change Han-Eul’s view of the world—and his feelings for his butler.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
